{"id":"m4-502","m":4,"paper":"天津市选调2018年应届优秀大学毕业生到基层培养锻炼考试题（网友回忆版）","region":"天津","year":2018,"q":10,"multi":0,"groups":[{"material":null,"qs":[{"n":1,"qid":"2165984","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"101  203  210  250  310  （    ）","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"324"},{"k":"B","t":"352"},{"k":"C","t":"385"},{"k":"D","t":"410"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>数列作差或递推均无规律，观察发现数列较长，考虑分组。交叉分组后，奇数项为：101、210、310，将每项各位数相加，其和组成新数列为：2、3、4，是公差为1的等差数列。偶数项为：203、250、（    ），将每项各位数相加，其和组成的数列为：5、7、（    ），猜测是公差为2的等差数列，故题目所求项各位数相加之和应为9，只有A选项<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-22b8e82594754ed6.png\" />满足要求。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":2,"qid":"2165985","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"-1  0  1  2  9  （  ）","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"11"},{"k":"B","t":"82"},{"k":"C","t":"720"},{"k":"D","t":"730"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>数列本身没有特点，但连同选项一起观察，数列变化幅度可能较大，考虑幂次。从相对较大项着手查找规律，观察可发现：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-27a5dee9f78beaa4.png\" />，继续验证可知：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6f0c76ce3bba22af.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-812ae84ddb06bd27.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3aa5dedb42db5f9d.png\" />。因此规律为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1d4c4474c3d7ea1f.png\" />，故<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-37144bad00266ced.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":3,"qid":"2165986","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"1  196  27  144  25  100  （  ）","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"7"},{"k":"B","t":"8"},{"k":"C","t":"9"},{"k":"D","t":"11"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>数列较长，考虑分组。交叉分组后，奇数项为：1、27、25、（ ），各项均为幂次数，可表达为：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-01a8291d7f0f733d.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0e861e72c007b21b.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-64f5a376e589fa9d.png\" />、（ ），底数为连续奇数，指数是公差为-1的等差数列，故推断所求项为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-deaefd4a2dad4e4f.png\" />。偶数项为：196、144、100，各项均为平方数，可表达为：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3cc820dcc1914f3e.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f7846d59fcdde423.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-dfc25bc83f2ed9db.png\" />，底数为递减的连续偶数列。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":4,"qid":"2165987","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"2  3  11  124  （  ）","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"16367"},{"k":"B","t":"15943"},{"k":"C","t":"15387"},{"k":"D","t":"14269"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>数列起伏较大，考虑幂次。从较大项着手查找规律，观察可发现：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e9ba418c51d9dcab.png\" />，代入其他验证：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f8449b71c5e61186.png\" />，因此规律为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-55711b34290908a3.png\" />。故所求项<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f741de0d55243d38.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":5,"qid":"2165988","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"0  0  2  12  （    ）","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"8"},{"k":"B","t":"36"},{"k":"C","t":"12"},{"k":"D","t":"32"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>数列变化幅度不大且大部分呈递增趋势，优先考虑作差，无规律，则考虑因式分解。原数列各项因式分解：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e2627d0451e2efdd.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9cb6fe3b4f4baf89.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b7d3aaebbd0530d1.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6cb0fa5a7dbbd6c1.png\" />。分解后的数列左子列为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8c3de2ee5105bdf2.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-50ad8f2aa40f352c.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f087fd98ed06c983.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2993db65573f912e.png\" />，该数列是平方数列，底数是公差为1的等差数列；右子列为0，1，2，3，是公差为1的等差数列，故所求项的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ff3b45f761e163e2.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c61301deddb7f7ca.png\" />，即<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-20f7bba73aa1343c.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":6,"qid":"2165989","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>在一块直角三角形绿地的周边上植树，共植了12棵树，如果树间距为一米，绿地面积是<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-06b2827b99b623b1.png\" />，问在绿地的斜边上最多能植多少棵树？</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"7"},{"k":"B","t":"5"},{"k":"C","t":"6"},{"k":"D","t":"8"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>方法一：根据题意可知，该直角三角形的周长为12米，两直角边的乘积为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f286f71cf15e80db.png\" />米，故该绿地两条直角边边长分别为3米，4米，斜边长为5米。要使斜边上种树最多，则斜边两头需各栽一棵，故在绿地的斜边上最多能植<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-97dfe47512140ef3.png\" />棵。</p><p>方法二：根据题意可知，该直角三角形的周长为12，两直角边的乘积为12。设直角三角形两直角边长为a、b，斜边长为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c6fbd9b1541ef458.png\" />，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3a0f8321ae5ae492.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-88411459497fbb19.png\" />。解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-55ca278f7d1fe1f2.png\" />，则斜边长<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-24e5329cf2c6d93f.png\" />。要使斜边上种树最多，则斜边两头需各栽一棵，故在绿地的斜边上最多能植<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-97dfe47512140ef3.png\" />棵。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":7,"qid":"2165990","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"一个停车场有50辆汽车，其中红色轿车35辆，夏利轿车28辆，既不是红色轿车又不是夏利轿车8辆，问停车场有红色夏利轿车多少辆？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"14辆"},{"k":"B","t":"21辆"},{"k":"C","t":"15辆"},{"k":"D","t":"22辆"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>两者容斥问题，套用公式：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-100a610790a59b86.png\" />。红色轿车<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4d90d7a7e1165b03.png\" />夏利轿车<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7f807961390e47fd.png\" />红色夏利轿车<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0c793ae1bc0b6efa.png\" />总数<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7f807961390e47fd.png\" />既不是红色轿车又不是夏利轿车，即<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3c76feb446a931a6.png\" />，故停车场有红色夏利轿车<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2de3d3b3575db782.png\" />辆。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":8,"qid":"2165991","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某职业大学的750名学生或上计算机课，或上规划设计课，或两门都上。如果有489名学生上计算机课，606名学生上规划设计课，问两门都上的学生是多少？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"118人"},{"k":"B","t":"114人"},{"k":"C","t":"261人"},{"k":"D","t":"345人"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>由题意可知此题为两集合容斥问题。根据两集合容斥公式<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-100a610790a59b86.png\" />，代入数据<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-bd3b889fd5450f7e.png\" />，则两门都上的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d07b12f41ad0da49.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":9,"qid":"2165992","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>三个游泳运动员一起练习，当甲游1圈时，乙正好超过甲半圈，丙超过甲<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b4b9a1cd2e380953.png\" />圈，按此速度三人共游了15圈。问丙游了多少圈？</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"7圈"},{"k":"B","t":"6圈"},{"k":"C","t":"5圈"},{"k":"D","t":"4圈"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>由题意可知，时间相同时，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6f98b1e32d101324.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ce28b4d0a9b9c78d.png\" />则丙游的圈数<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a2f521c2c475d760.png\" />圈。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":10,"qid":"2165993","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"一个边长为8的正立方体，由若干个边长为1的立方体组成，现在要将大立方体表面涂成黄色，问一共有多少个小立方体涂上了黄色？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"384"},{"k":"B","t":"328"},{"k":"C","t":"324"},{"k":"D","t":"296"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>由题意可知，该正方体共由<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-699feb11d6cbebe8.png\" />个小立方体组成，去除被涂色的小立方体，剩下没被涂色的是一个棱长为6的立方体，即有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ee7b6526c1d83920.png\" />个小立方体。因此一共有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d28024afe5613570.png\" />个小立方体涂上了黄色。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"}]}]}